ermöglicht","pt":"O que é release? É um processo de gerenciamento de versões que envolve a criação de uma nova versão de um projeto.","ru":"Что такое релиз? Это процесс управления версиями, который включает создание новой версии проекта.","ar":"ما هو الإصدار؟ هو عملية لإدارة الإصدارات تتضمن إنشاء إصدار جديد لمشروع."},"features":{"en":["Handles version determination using Git","Generates changelogs automatically","Updates files and creates git tags","Verifies local branch and syncs with remote origin","Runs on a WASM virtual machine with 0 dependencies"],"zh":["基于Go的WASM虚拟机","版本确定和变更日志生成","Git标签和分支管理","自动化版本发布流程","支持WebAssembly运行时环境"],"ja":["GoによるWASM仮想マシン","バージョンの決定と変更ログの生成","Gitタグ付けとブランチ管理","バージョンのリリースプロセスを自動化","WebAssemblyランタイム環境のサポート"],"ko":["Go 기반의 WASM 가상 머신","버전 결정과 변경 로그 생성","Git 태그 지정과 브랜치 관리","버전 릴리스 프로세스를 자동화","WebAssembly 런타임 환경 지원"],"es":["Determinación de versión automática","Generación de changelog","Actualización de archivos","Etiquetado de Git","Compatibilidad con Go y WASM","Sin dependencias"],"fr":["Détermination de version automatique","Génération de changelog","Mise à jour de fichiers","Étiquetage de Git","Compatibilité avec Go et WASM","Sans dépendances"],"de":["Automatische Versionsbestimmung","Changelog-Generierung","Datei-Update","Git-Tagging","Kompatibilität mit Go und WASM","Ohne Abhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Determinação da versão com git branch","Geração de changelog automática","Atualização de arquivos com git fetch","Criação de tags com git tag","Suporte ao WASM e WebAssembly","Desenvolvido em Go com 0 dependências"],"ru":["Определение версии с помощью git branch","Автоматическая генерация changelog","Обновление файлов с помощью git fetch","Создание тегов с помощью git tag","Поддержка WASM и WebAssembly","Разработано на Go с 0 зависимостями"],"ar":["تحديد الإصدار باستخدام git branch","توليد سجل التغييرات تلقائيًا","تحديث الملفات باستخدام git fetch","إنشاء علامات باستخدام git tag","دعم WASM و WebAssembly","تم تطويره bằng Go مع 0 الاعتماديات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use release","release setup guide","go release management","webassembly release process","release alternative to manual versioning","release vs semantic release","install release","release for ai agents","automated versioning with release"],"zh":["Release技能","Go语言","WASM虚拟机","版本发布","变更日志","Git标签","AIエージェント","自动化版本发布"],"ja":["Releaseスキル","Go言語","WASM仮想マシン","バージョンのリリース","変更ログ","Gitタグ付け","AIエージェント","バージョンの自動化リリース"],"ko":["Release 스킬","Go 언어","WASM 가상 머신","버전 릴리스","변경 로그","Git 태그 지정","AI 에이전트","버전 자동 릴리스"],"es":["release con Go","WASM con Go","determinación de versión","generación de changelog","Herramientas de release para WASM","Guías de configuración de release","Desarrollo de software con Go","Agentes de inteligencia artificial para release","Herramientas de automatización de release"],"fr":["release avec Go","WASM avec Go","détermination de version","génération de changelog","Outils de release pour WASM","Guides de configuration de release","Développement de logiciels avec Go","Agents d''intelligence artificielle pour release","Outils d''automatisation de release"],"de":["Release mit Go","WASM mit Go","Versionsbestimmung","Changelog-Generierung","Release-Tools für WASM","Konfigurationsanleitungen für Release","Software-Entwicklung mit Go","Künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten für Release","Automatisierungstools für Release"],"pt":["release","gerenciamento de versões","git branch","changelog","WASM","WebAssembly","Go","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de lançamento de versão"],"ru":["релиз","управление версиями","git branch","changelog","WASM","WebAssembly","Go","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты для создания релиза"],"ar":["الإصدار","إدارة الإصدارات","git branch","سجل التغييرات","WASM","WebAssembly","Go","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات إدارة الإصدارات"]}},"owner":"ziggy42","repo":"epsilon","repoPath":"ziggy42/epsilon","stars":414,"forks":9,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T14:59:17Z","topics":["go","golang","wasm","webassembly","webassembly-runtime"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release","description":"Use this skill when the user wants to cut a new release.","bodyPreview":"# Release\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides the agent through the process of cutting a new release for\nthis project. It handles version determination, changelog generation, file\nupdates, and git tagging.\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 1. Preparation & Version Determination\n\n1.  **Check Branch**: Run `git branch --show-current`. If the output is not\n    `main`, stop and inform the user that releases must be cut from the `main`\n    branch.\n2.  **Sync with Remote**: Run `git fetch origin main`. Then verify local","body":"# Release\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides the agent through the process of cutting a new release for\nthis project. It handles version determination, changelog generation, file\nupdates, and git tagging.\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 1. Preparation & Version Determination\n\n1.  **Check Branch**: Run `git branch --show-current`. If the output is not\n    `main`, stop and inform the user that releases must be cut from the `main`\n    branch.\n2.  **Sync with Remote**: Run `git fetch origin main`. Then verify local is\n    up-to-date by running `git rev-list HEAD..origin/main --count`. If the count\n    is non-zero, stop and inform the user that their local `main` is behind\n    `origin/main` and they need to pull first.\n3.  **Check Working Tree**: Run `git status --porcelain`.\n    - **CRITICAL**: If the command produces **ANY** output (even for untracked\n      files or documentation changes), you **MUST ABORT IMMEDIATELY**.\n    - **DO NOT** attempt to analyze the changes.\n    - **DO NOT** ask the user if they want to proceed.\n    - **STOP** and inform the user: \"Working tree is not clean. Please commit or\n      stash changes before releasing.\"\n4.  **Check Current Version**: Read `epsilon/version.go` to find the current\n    version (e.g., \"0.0.3\").\n5.  **Determine Target Version**:\n    - **User Provided**: If the user specified a version, validate it. It must\n      be semantically greater than the current version. If invalid, reject it\n      and explain why.\n    - **Auto-Increment**: If no version was provided, increment the **patch**\n      level of the current version (e.g., 0.0.3 -> 0.0.4).\n6.  **Confirm**: Briefly mention the plan to the user (e.g., \"Preparing release\n    for v0.0.4...\").\n\n### 2. Verification\n\n1.  **Build**: Run `go build ./...`. If the build fails, stop and report the\n    error.\n2.  **Run Tests**: Run `go test ./...`. If tests fail, stop and report the\n    errors.\n3.  **Compare Benchmarks**: Find the previous release tag using\n    `git describe --tags --abbrev=0`. Then run\n    `./internal/benchmarks/compare.py --base <last_tag> --target .` to compare\n    performance against the last release. Present the results to the user and\n    flag any significant regressions. **NOTE**: This process can take several\n    minutes as it runs the full benchmark suite twice; ensure a reasonable\n    timeout (e.g., 10m) is applied.\n\n### 3. Changelog Generation\n\n**Only proceed if verification passes.**\n\n1.  **Identify Range**: Find the previous release tag using\n    `git describe --tags --abbrev=0`.\n2.  **Fetch Commits**: Run\n    `git log --no-merges --pretty=format:\"%h %s%n%b\" <last_tag>..HEAD`.\n3.  **Draft Content**: Analyze the commit messages (subject and body) to create\n    a new CHANGELOG entry.\n    - **Deep Inspection**: Look at the commit **body** for additional context.\n      Squashed PRs often include a detailed list of changes, bullet points, or\n      rationale in the description. Use this to create a more informative\n      summary.\n    - **Audience**: The changelog is for **end users**. Focus on changes that\n      affect how users interact with the project.\n    - **Style**: Mimic the existing style in `CHANGELOG.md`.\n    - **Filtering**: Include only changes that matter to users: new features,\n      bug fixes, API changes. Exclude chores, typos, refactoring, CI tweaks, and\n      internal tooling changes.\n    - **Grouping**: Group by category if appropriate (e.g., API Changes,\n      Performance, Fixes).\n    - **Breaking Changes**: Explicitly highlight any breaking changes.\n    - **Format**:\n\n      ```markdown\n      ## [Version] - YYYY-MM-DD\n\n      - Description of change (#PR or commit hash if available).\n      - ...\n      ```\n\n4.  **Review**: Present the drafted CHANGELOG entry to the user and ask for\n    confirmation. **Do not proceed without user approval.**\n\n### 4. Execution\n\n**Only proceed after User Confirmation of the changelog.**\n\n1.  **Update CHANGELOG.md**:\n    - Read `CHANGELOG.md`.\n    - Insert the new entry at the top of the changelog (after the header\n      section).\n    - Write the file.\n2.  **Update Version**:\n    - Update `epsilon/version.go` with the new version string.\n3.  **Commit & Tag**:\n    - Run `git add CHANGELOG.md epsilon/version.go`.\n    - Run `git commit -m \"Release version <Version>\"`.\n    - Run `git tag v<Version>`.\n4.  **Push**:\n    - Run `git push origin main --tags`.\n5.  **Finalize**:\n    - Inform the user the release is committed, tagged, and pushed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:28:10.017Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated release management for Go and WebAssembly projects.","zh":"适合需要自动化发布管理的Go和WebAssembly项目的开发代理。","ja":"GoおよびWebAssemblyプロジェクトの自動化されたリリース管理を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Go 및 WebAssembly 프로젝트에 대한 자동화된 릴리스 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de versiones automatizada para proyectos de Go y WebAssembly.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de version automatisée pour les projets Go et WebAssembly.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Versionierung für Go- und WebAssembly-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de lançamento automatizado para projetos Go e WebAssembly.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированное управление выпусками для проектов Go и WebAssembly.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة الإصدار الآلي لمشاريع Go و WebAssembly."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate version determination, changelog generation, and git tagging, streamlining the release process for projects using Git and supporting file updates.","zh":"赋予代理自动确定版本、生成变更日志和Git标签的能力，简化了使用Git和支持文件更新的项目的发布流程。","ja":"バージョンの自動決定、変更ログの生成、およびGitタグ付けをエージェントに可能にし、Gitおよびファイルの更新をサポートするプロジェクトのリリースプロセスを合理化します。","ko":"에이전트가 버전을 자동으로 결정하고, 변경 로그를 생성하며, Git 태그를 생성할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 Git 및 파일 업데이트를 지원하는 프로젝트의 릴리스 프로세스를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la determinación de la versión, la generación de registros de cambios y la etiquetado de git, simplificando el proceso de lanzamiento para proyectos que utilizan Git y admiten actualizaciones de archivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la détermination de la version, la génération de journaux des modifications et le marquage Git, simplifiant le processus de publication pour les projets utilisant Git et prenant en charge les mises à jour de fichiers.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Versionsbestimmung, die Generierung von Änderungsprotokollen und das Git-Tagging zu automatisieren, wodurch der Release-Prozess für Projekte, die Git verwenden und Dateiaktualisierungen unterstützen, rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a determinação da versão, geração de changelog e marcação de git, simplificando o processo de lançamento para projetos que usam Git e suportam atualizações de arquivos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать определение версии, генерацию changelog и маркировку git, упрощая процесс выпуска для проектов, использующих Git и поддерживающих обновления файлов.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توفير تحديد الإصدار آلي وتوليد سجل التغييرات وترقيم git، مبسطًا عملية الإصدار لمشاريع تستخدم Git وتدعم تحديثات الملفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating release cuts for Go projects","Generating changelogs for WebAssembly applications","Managing git tags for version control"],"zh":["自动化Go项目的发布","为WebAssembly应用程序生成变更日志","管理Git标签以进行版本控制"],"ja":["Goプロジェクトのリリースカットを自動化する","WebAssemblyアプリケーションの変更ログを生成する","バージョン管理のためのGitタグを管理する"],"ko":["Go 프로젝트의 릴리스를 자동화하는 것","WebAssembly 애플리케이션에 대한 변경 로그를 생성하는 것","버전 관리를 위한 Git 태그를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de versiones para proyectos de Go","Generación de registros de cambios para aplicaciones de WebAssembly","Gestión de etiquetas de git para el control de versiones"],"fr":["Automatisation des versions pour les projets Go","Génération de journaux des modifications pour les applications WebAssembly","Gestion des étiquettes Git pour le contrôle de version"],"de":["Automatisierung von Versionen für Go-Projekte","Generierung von Änderungsprotokollen für WebAssembly-Anwendungen","Verwaltung von Git-Tags für die Versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Automatizar cortes de lançamento para projetos Go","Gerar changelogs para aplicações WebAssembly","Gerenciar marcações de git para controle de versão"],"ru":["Автоматизация выпусков для проектов Go","Генерация changelog для приложений WebAssembly","Управление маркировкой git для контроля версий"],"ar":["تحسين الإصدارات الآلية لمشاريع Go","توليد سجلات التغييرات لتطبيقات WebAssembly","إدارة علامات git للتحكم في الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Must be run from the ''main'' branch","Limited to projects using Git for version control"],"zh":["需要Git安装","必须从''main''分支运行","仅限使用Git进行版本控制的项目"],"ja":["Gitのインストールが必要","''main''ブランチから実行する必要がある","Gitを使用してバージョン管理を行うプロジェクトのみに制限される"],"ko":["Git 설치가 필요함","''main'' 브랜치에서 실행해야 함","Git을 사용하여 버전 관리를 하는 프로젝트에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Git","Debe ejecutarse desde la rama ''main''","Limitado a proyectos que utilizan Git para el control de versiones"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","Doit être exécuté à partir de la branche ''main''","Limité aux projets utilisant Git pour le contrôle de version"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Git","Muss von dem ''main''-Zweig aus ausgeführt werden","Begrenzt auf Projekte, die Git für die Versionskontrolle verwenden"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Deve ser executado a partir da branch ''main''","Limitado a projetos que usam Git para controle de versão"],"ru":["Требуется установка Git","Должно быть запущено из ветки ''main''","Ограничен проектами, использующими Git для контроля версий"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Git","يجب تشغيله من الفرع ''main''","محدود بمشاريع تستخدم Git للتحكم في الإصدار"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"34ba7896fb562499db5f5e863721d6deb618a9981cf7883b09318329d9f08f93","qualityScore":52}');
