 | AI Ag...","zh":"WordPress Pro Setup Guide - AIエージェント集成","ja":"WordPress Pro ベストプラクティス - AIエージェントを使用したカスタムテーマ開発","ko":"WordPress Pro 개발 가이드 - AI 도구와 함께하는 WooCommerce 최적화","es":"Guía de configuración de WordPress Pro con IA","fr":"Guide de configuration de WordPress Pro avec IA","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für WordPress Pro mit KI","pt":"Guia de Configuração do WordPress Pro: Desenvolvimento de...","ru":"Настройка WordPress Pro: Руководство по созданию тем и пл...","ar":"دليل إعداد ووردبريس پرو: تطوير الثيمات والأدوات الإضافية ..."},"description":{"en":"Unlock custom WordPress themes, plugins, and Gutenberg blocks with wordpress-pro. Get started with AI-driven WordPress development today!","zh":"使用WordPress Pro AIエージェント，创建可配置的Figma登录页面和自定义WordPress主题，提高性能和安全性","ja":"WordPress Pro AIエージェントを使用して、カスタムテーマ、プラグイン、Gutenbergブロックを開発し、WooCommerceを最適化する","ko":"WordPress Pro AI 도구를 사용하여 REST API를 통합하고、パフォーマンスを最適化し、セキュアでスケーラブルなWordPressソリューションを構築する","es":"Aprende a crear temas personalizados de WordPress con Gutenberg y WooCommerce utilizando herramientas de IA","fr":"Découvrez comment créer des thèmes personnalisés WordPress avec Gutenberg et WooCommerce en utilisant des outils d''IA","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Themen mit Gutenberg und WooCommerce mithilfe von KI-Tools erstellen","pt":"Aprenda a criar temas e plugins personalizados para WordPress com PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg e WooCommerce, e otimize o desempenho do seu site","ru":"Узнайте, как создавать кастомные темы и плагины для WordPress с помощью PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg и WooCommerce, и оптимизируйте производительность вашего сайта с ...","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء ثيمات وأدوات إضافية مخصصة لـ ووردبريس باستخدام PHP 8.1+ و Gutenberg و WooCommerce، واضبط أداء الموقع الإلكتروني باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"wordpress-pro is a specialized AI agent skill for expert WordPress developers, focusing on custom theme development, plugin creation, and performance optimization.","zh":"WordPress Pro是一种高级WordPress开发工具，使用AIエージェント创建可配置的Figma登录页面和自定义WordPress主题","ja":"WordPress Proは、AIエージェントを使用したカスタムテーマ、プラグイン、Gutenbergブロックの開発を可能にする高级WordPress開発ツールです","ko":"WordPress Pro는 AI 도구를 사용하여 REST API를 통합하고、パフォーマンスを最適化し、セキュアでスケーラブルなWordPressソリューションを構築するための開発ツールです","es":"WordPress Pro es un desarrollador senior de WordPress que crea soluciones personalizadas con PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg y WooCommerce","fr":"WordPress Pro est un développeur senior WordPress qui crée des solutions personnalisées avec PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg et WooCommerce","de":"WordPress Pro ist ein Senior-Entwickler für WordPress, der benutzerdefinierte Lösungen mit PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg und WooCommerce erstellt","pt":"O que é WordPress Pro? É um especialista em desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas para WordPress","ru":"Что такое WordPress Pro? Это эксперт в области разработки кастомных решений для WordPress","ar":"ما هو ووردبريس پرو؟ هو مختص في تطوير حلول مخصصة لـ ووردبريس"},"features":{"en":["Develops custom WordPress themes with modern PHP 8.1+","Creates Gutenberg blocks for enhanced content creation","Customizes WooCommerce for e-commerce solutions","Integrates REST API for seamless data exchange","Optimizes WordPress performance for scalable and secure solutions"],"zh":["使用Figma创建可配置的登录页面","开发自定义WordPress主题","Gutenberg块开发","WooCommerce定制","REST API集成","性能优化"],"ja":["Figmaを使用したカスタムテーマの開発","プラグイン開発","Gutenbergブロック開発","WooCommerceカスタマイズ","REST API統合","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Figma를 사용한 커스텀 테마 개발","플러그인 개발","Gutenberg 블록 개발","WooCommerce 커스터마이즈","REST API 통합","성능 최적화"],"es":["Desarrollo de temas personalizados con PHP 8.1+","Creación de plugins y bloques de Gutenberg","Personalización de WooCommerce","Integración de la API de REST","Optimización del rendimiento de WordPress"],"fr":["Développement de thèmes personnalisés avec PHP 8.1+","Création de plugins et de blocs Gutenberg","Personnalisation de WooCommerce","Intégration de l''API REST","Optimisation des performances de WordPress"],"de":["Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Themen mit PHP 8.1+","Erstellung von Plugins und Gutenberg-Blöcken","Anpassung von WooCommerce","Integration der REST-API","Leistungsoptimierung von WordPress"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de temas personalizados com PHP 8.1+","Criação de plugins com Gutenberg","Integração com WooCommerce","Otimização de desempenho do WordPress","Desenvolvimento de blocos de Gutenberg","Integração com REST API"],"ru":["Разработка кастомных тем с помощью PHP 8.1+","Создание плагинов с помощью Gutenberg","Интеграция с WooCommerce","Оптимизация производительности WordPress","Разработка блоков Gutenberg","Интеграция с REST API"],"ar":["تطوير الثيمات المخصصة باستخدام PHP 8.1+","إنشاء الأدوات الإضافية مع Gutenberg","التكامل مع WooCommerce","تحسين أداء ووردبريس","تطوير كتلة Gutenberg","التكامل مع REST API"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use wordpress-pro","wordpress-pro setup guide","wordpress-pro vs elementor","wordpress-pro install","what is wordpress-pro","wordpress-pro expert developer","wordpress-pro gutenberg blocks","wordpress-pro performance optimization"],"zh":["WordPress Pro","AIエージェント","Figma","WordPress主题开发","Gutenberg块开发","WooCommerce定制","REST API集成","性能优化"],"ja":["WordPress Pro","AIエージェント","Figma","WordPressテーマ開発","Gutenbergブロック開発","WooCommerceカスタマイズ","REST API統合","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["WordPress Pro","AI 도구","Figma","WordPress 테마 개발","Gutenberg 블록 개발","WooCommerce 커스터마이즈","REST API 통합","성능 최적화"],"es":["wordpress pro","desarrollo de wordpress","temas personalizados","plugins de wordpress","gutenberg","woocommerce","optimización de rendimiento","herramientas de ia para wordpress"],"fr":["wordpress pro","développement de wordpress","thèmes personnalisés","plugins de wordpress","gutenberg","woocommerce","optimisation des performances","outils d''ia pour wordpress"],"de":["wordpress pro","wordpress-entwicklung","benutzerdefinierte themen","wordpress-plugins","gutenberg","woocommerce","leistungsoptimierung","ki-tools für wordpress"],"pt":["wordpress pro","desenvolvimento de temas","plugins personalizados","php 8.1+","gutenberg","woocommerce","otimização de desempenho","desenvolvimento de blocos","rest api"],"ru":["wordpress pro","разработка кастомных тем","плагины","php 8.1+","gutenberg","woocommerce","оптимизация производительности","разработка блоков","rest api","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["ووردبريس پرو","تطوير الثيمات المخصصة","الأدوات الإضافية","php 8.1+","gutenberg","woocommerce","تحسين الأداء","تطوير الكتلة","rest api","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ErickAguilar95","repo":"full_wordpress_figma_creator","repoPath":"ErickAguilar95/full_wordpress_figma_creator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.340Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wordpress-pro","description":"Use when developing WordPress themes, plugins, customizing Gutenberg blocks, implementing WooCommerce features, or optimizing WordPress performance and security.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress s","body":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress sites following WordPress coding standards and best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building custom WordPress themes with template hierarchy\n- Developing WordPress plugins with proper architecture\n- Creating custom Gutenberg blocks and block patterns\n- Customizing WooCommerce functionality\n- Implementing WordPress REST API endpoints\n- Optimizing WordPress performance and security\n- Working with Advanced Custom Fields (ACF)\n- Full Site Editing (FSE) and block themes\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Understand WordPress context, existing setup, goals\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan theme/plugin structure, hooks, data flow\n3. **Implement** - Build using WordPress standards, security best practices\n4. **Optimize** - Cache, query optimization, asset optimization\n5. **Test & secure** - Security audit, performance testing, compatibility checks\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Theme Development | `references/theme-development.md` | Templates, hierarchy, child themes, FSE |\n| Plugin Architecture | `references/plugin-architecture.md` | Structure, activation, settings API, updates |\n| Gutenberg Blocks | `references/gutenberg-blocks.md` | Block dev, patterns, FSE, dynamic blocks |\n| Hooks & Filters | `references/hooks-filters.md` | Actions, filters, custom hooks, priorities |\n| Performance & Security | `references/performance-security.md` | Caching, optimization, hardening, backups |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow WordPress Coding Standards (WPCS)\n- Use nonces for form submissions\n- Sanitize all user inputs with appropriate functions\n- Escape all outputs (esc_html, esc_url, esc_attr)\n- Use prepared statements for database queries\n- Implement proper capability checks\n- Enqueue scripts/styles properly (wp_enqueue_*)\n- Use WordPress hooks instead of modifying core\n- Write translatable strings with text domains\n- Test across multiple WordPress versions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Modify WordPress core files\n- Use PHP short tags or deprecated functions\n- Trust user input without sanitization\n- Output data without escaping\n- Hardcode database table names (use $wpdb->prefix)\n- Skip capability checks in admin functions\n- Ignore SQL injection vulnerabilities\n- Bundle unnecessary libraries (use WordPress APIs)\n- Create security vulnerabilities through file uploads\n- Skip internationalization (i18n)\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WordPress features, provide:\n1. Main plugin/theme file with proper headers\n2. Relevant template files or block code\n3. Functions with proper WordPress hooks\n4. Security implementations (nonces, sanitization, escaping)\n5. Brief explanation of WordPress-specific patterns used\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nWordPress 6.4+, PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg, WooCommerce, ACF, REST API, WP-CLI, block development, theme customizer, widget API, shortcode API, transients, object caching, query optimization, security hardening, WPCS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:26.266Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring advanced WordPress customization and PHP 8.1+ expertise.","zh":"适合需要高级WordPress定制和PHP 8.1+专业知识的Web开发代理。","ja":"WordPressの高度なカスタマイズとPHP 8.1+の専門知識を必要とするWeb開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 워드프레스 사용자 정의 및 PHP 8.1+ 전문 지식을 요구하는 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo web que requieren personalización avanzada de WordPress y experiencia en PHP 8.1+.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement web nécessitant une personnalisation avancée de WordPress et une expertise en PHP 8.1+.","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte WordPress-Anpassung und PHP 8.1+-Expertise erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento web que exigem personalização avançada do WordPress e especialização em PHP 8.1+.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, требующих продвинутой настройки WordPress и опыта работы с PHP 8.1+.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذين يتطلبون تعديلات متقدمة لبرنامج WordPress وخبير في PHP 8.1+."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build custom WordPress themes, plugins, and Gutenberg blocks, leveraging PHP 8.1+, WooCommerce customization, and REST API integration for enhanced performance and security.","zh":"赋予代理构建自定义WordPress主题、插件和Gutenberg块的能力，利用PHP 8.1+、WooCommerce定制和REST API集成提高性能和安全性。","ja":"エージェントがPHP 8.1+、WooCommerceのカスタマイズ、REST APIの統合を利用して、カスタムのWordPressテーマ、プラグイン、Gutenbergブロックを構築する能力を提供し、パフォーマンスとセキュリティを向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 PHP 8.1+와 WooCommerce 사용자 정의 및 REST API 통합을 사용하여 사용자 지정 WordPress 테마, 플러그인 및 Gutenberg 블록을 구축할 수 있도록 하여 성능과 보안을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear temas personalizados de WordPress, plugins y bloques de Gutenberg, aprovechando PHP 8.1+, la personalización de WooCommerce y la integración de REST API para un mejor rendimiento y seguridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des thèmes WordPress personnalisés, des plugins et des blocs Gutenberg, en exploitant PHP 8.1+, la personnalisation de WooCommerce et l''intégration de REST API pour améliorer les performances et la sécurité.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Themes, -Plugins und -Gutenberg-Blöcke zu erstellen, indem sie PHP 8.1+, WooCommerce-Anpassung und REST-API-Integration für verbesserte Leistung und Sicherheit nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem temas personalizados do WordPress, plug-ins e blocos do Gutenberg, utilizando PHP 8.1+, personalização do WooCommerce e integração da REST API para melhorar o desempenho e a segurança.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать пользовательские темы WordPress, плагины и блоки Gutenberg, используя PHP 8.1+, настройку WooCommerce и интеграцию REST API для повышения производительности и безопасности.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من بناء مواضيع مخصصة لبرنامج WordPress وأدوات إضافية وبلاطات جوتنبرج، باستخدام PHP 8.1+ وتعديلات متقدمة للوكميرس وتكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST لتحسين الأداء والأمان."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing custom WordPress themes with modern PHP and Gutenberg block development","Creating scalable WooCommerce solutions with advanced customization and REST API integration","Optimizing WordPress performance and security using PHP 8.1+ and expert development techniques"],"zh":["使用现代PHP和Gutenberg块开发开发自定义WordPress主题","创建可扩展的WooCommerce解决方案，使用高级自定义和REST API集成","使用PHP 8.1+和专家开发技术优化WordPress性能和安全性"],"ja":["モダンなPHPとGutenbergブロック開発を使用してカスタムのWordPressテーマを開発する","高度なカスタマイズとREST APIの統合を使用してスケーラブルなWooCommerceソリューションを作成する","PHP 8.1+と専門家の開発テクニックを使用してWordPressのパフォーマンスとセキュリティを最適化する"],"ko":["현대적인 PHP와 Gutenberg 블록 개발을 사용하여 사용자 지정 WordPress 테마를 개발하는 것","고급 사용자 정의 및 REST API 통합을 사용하여 확장 가능한 WooCommerce 솔루션을 생성하는 것","PHP 8.1+ 및 전문가 개발 기술을 사용하여 WordPress 성능 및 보안 최적화"],"es":["Desarrollar temas personalizados de WordPress con PHP moderno y desarrollo de bloques de Gutenberg","Crear soluciones de WooCommerce escalables con personalización avanzada y integración de REST API","Optimizar el rendimiento y la seguridad de WordPress utilizando PHP 8.1+ y técnicas de desarrollo de expertos"],"fr":["Développer des thèmes WordPress personnalisés avec PHP moderne et développement de blocs Gutenberg","Créer des solutions WooCommerce évolutives avec personnalisation avancée et intégration de REST API","Optimiser les performances et la sécurité de WordPress en utilisant PHP 8.1+ et des techniques de développement d''experts"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten WordPress-Themes mit modernem PHP und Gutenberg-Block-Entwicklung","Erstellen von skalierbaren WooCommerce-Lösungen mit erweiterter Anpassung und REST-API-Integration","Optimieren von WordPress-Leistung und -Sicherheit unter Verwendung von PHP 8.1+ und Experten-Entwicklungstechniken"],"pt":["Desenvolver temas personalizados do WordPress com PHP moderno e desenvolvimento de blocos do Gutenberg","Criar soluções escaláveis do WooCommerce com personalização avançada e integração da REST API","Otimizar o desempenho e a segurança do WordPress usando PHP 8.1+ e técnicas de desenvolvimento especializadas"],"ru":["Разработка пользовательских тем WordPress с современным PHP и разработкой блоков Gutenberg","Создание масштабируемых решений WooCommerce с продвинутой настройкой и интеграцией REST API","Оптимизация производительности и безопасности WordPress с помощью PHP 8.1+ и экспертных методов разработки"],"ar":["تطوير مواضيع مخصصة لبرنامج WordPress باستخدام PHP الحديث وتطوير بلاطات جوتنبرج","إنشاء حلول متوسعة للوكميرس مع تعديلات متقدمة وتكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST","تحسين الأداء والأمان لبرنامج WordPress باستخدام PHP 8.1+ وเทคนيكات تطوير الخبراء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 8.1+ compatibility","WordPress-specific development only","Expertise in Gutenberg block development and WooCommerce customization necessary"],"zh":["需要PHP 8.1+兼容性","仅限WordPress特定开发","需要Gutenberg块开发和WooCommerce定制的专业知识"],"ja":["PHP 8.1+の互換性が必要","WordPress特有の開発のみ","Gutenbergブロック開発とWooCommerceのカスタマイズの専門知識が必要"],"ko":["PHP 8.1+ 호환성이 필요함","워드프레스 전용 개발만 해당함","구텐베르크 블록 개발 및 우커머스 사용자 정의 전문 지식이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con PHP 8.1+","Desarrollo específico de WordPress solo","Se requiere experiencia en desarrollo de bloques de Gutenberg y personalización de WooCommerce"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec PHP 8.1+","Développement spécifique de WordPress uniquement","Une expertise en développement de blocs Gutenberg et en personnalisation de WooCommerce est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt PHP 8.1+-Kompatibilität","Nur WordPress-spezifische Entwicklung","Erfahrung in Gutenberg-Block-Entwicklung und WooCommerce-Anpassung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com PHP 8.1+","Desenvolvimento específico do WordPress apenas","Especialização em desenvolvimento de blocos do Gutenberg e personalização do WooCommerce necessária"],"ru":["Требуется совместимость с PHP 8.1+","Разработка только для WordPress","Необходим опыт работы с разработкой блоков Gutenberg и настройкой WooCommerce"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع PHP 8.1+","التطوير على برنامج WordPress فقط","الخبرة في تطوير بلاطات جوتنبرج وتعديلات متقدمة للوكميرس ضرورية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"161e8ea72a5640682907e80c2eec76f5e588d9a6c07125db79f4c9e067e33018","qualityScore":52}');
