DB API是为外部用户提供的AI智能代理功能，用于提高开发效率","ja":"commit-feature VDB APIは、外部ユーザー向けのAIエージェント機能を提供し、開発効率を向上させる","ko":"commit-feature VDB API는 외부 사용자를 위한 AI 에이전트 기능을 제공하여 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Commit-feature es una función de la VDB API para usuarios externos, diseñada para mejorar la eficiencia en el desarrollo","fr":"Commit-feature est une fonctionnalité de l''API VDB pour les utilisateurs externes, conçue pour améliorer l''efficacité dans le développement","de":"Commit-feature ist eine Funktion der VDB-API für externe Benutzer, die darauf abzielt, die Effizienz in der Entwicklung zu verbessern","pt":"O commit-feature é uma ferramenta de AI que permite a integração com a VDB API para usuários externos, melhorando a eficiência do trabalho","ru":"ИИ Агент commit-feature позволяет интегрироваться с VDB API для внешних пользователей,提高я эффективность работы","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي commit-feature تمكن من التكامل مع VDB API لمستخدمي الخارج، مما يحسن كفاءة العمل","en":"VDB API for external users"},"definition":{"en":"VDB API for external users"},"features":{"zh":["提供VDB API","支持外部用户","提高开发效率","实现AI智能代理功能","支持多种开发语言"],"ja":["VDB APIを提供","外部ユーザーをサポート","開発効率を向上させる","AIエージェント機能を実現","多くの開発言語をサポート"],"ko":["VDB API를 제공","외부 사용자를 지원","개발 효율성을 향상시키다","AI 에이전트 기능을 구현","여러 개발 언어를 지원"],"es":["Integración con VDB API"," Commit de características de forma eficiente","Mejora de la colaboración en el desarrollo","Soporte para usuarios externos","Flexibilidad en la implementación"],"fr":["Intégration avec l''API VDB","Commit de fonctionnalités de manière efficace","Amélioration de la collaboration dans le développement","Prise en charge des utilisateurs externes","Flexibilité dans la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Integration mit der VDB-API","Commit von Funktionen auf effiziente Weise","Verbesserung der Zusammenarbeit in der Entwicklung","Unterstützung für externe Benutzer","Flexibilität bei der Implementierung"],"pt":["Integração com VDB API","Melhoria da eficiência do trabalho","Ferramenta de AI para usuários externos","Compatibilidade com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para facilidade de uso"],"ru":["Интеграция с VDB API","Повышение эффективности работы","ИИ Агент для внешних пользователей","Совместимость с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для легкого использования"],"ar":["التكامل مع VDB API","تحسين كفاءة العمل","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي لمستخدمي الخارج","التوافق مع React و Python و Node.js","CLI لسهولة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用commit-feature VDB API","什么是AI智能代理","commit-feature VDB API替代品","commit-feature VDB API与其他工具的比较","commit-feature VDB API安装","commit-feature VDB API设置指南","AI智能代理工具","VDB API开发","外部用户API"],"ja":["commit-feature VDB APIの使用方法","AIエージェントとは","commit-feature VDB APIの代替","commit-feature VDB APIと他のツールの比較","commit-feature VDB APIのインストール","commit-feature VDB APIの設定ガイド","AIエージェントツール","VDB API開発","外部ユーザーAPI"],"ko":["commit-feature VDB API 사용법","AI 에이전트란","commit-feature VDB API 대안","commit-feature VDB API와 다른 도구의 비교","commit-feature VDB API 설치","commit-feature VDB API 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 도구","VDB API 개발","외부 사용자 API"],"es":["cómo usar commit-feature","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","VDB API alternativa","commit-feature vs Git","instalación de commit-feature","guía de configuración de VDB API"],"fr":["comment utiliser commit-feature","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","alternative à l''API VDB","commit-feature vs Git","installation de commit-feature","guide de configuration de l''API VDB"],"de":["wie man commit-feature verwendet","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Alternative zu VDB-API","commit-feature vs Git","Installation von commit-feature","Konfigurationshandbuch für VDB-API"],"pt":["como usar commit-feature","o que é VDB API","ferramentas de AI para desenvolvedores","commit-feature vs outras ferramentas","instalar commit-feature","guia de configuração do commit-feature"],"ru":["как использовать commit-feature","что такое VDB API","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","commit-feature vs другие инструменты","установить commit-feature","руководство по настройке commit-feature"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام commit-feature","ما هو VDB API","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","commit-feature مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت commit-feature","دليل إعداد commit-feature"]}},"owner":"Vulnetix","repo":"vdb-api","repoPath":"Vulnetix/vdb-api","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:20:06.317Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit-feature","description":"Stage changes, create conventional commit (no co-author), push to origin, and add detailed PR comment with session context","bodyPreview":"# Commit Feature Without Co-Authoring\n\nStage all changes, create a conventional commit message without Claude co-authoring, push to origin, and add a detailed PR comment with session context including TODOs and known issues.\n\n## Arguments\n\n`$ARGUMENTS` should contain:\n- **type** (required): `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `build`, `ci`, `revert`\n- **scope** (optional): Component or area affected (e.g., `api`, `ui`, `auth`, `database`)\n\nExamples:\n- `/commit-fe","body":"# Commit Feature Without Co-Authoring\n\nStage all changes, create a conventional commit message without Claude co-authoring, push to origin, and add a detailed PR comment with session context including TODOs and known issues.\n\n## Arguments\n\n`$ARGUMENTS` should contain:\n- **type** (required): `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `build`, `ci`, `revert`\n- **scope** (optional): Component or area affected (e.g., `api`, `ui`, `auth`, `database`)\n\nExamples:\n- `/commit-feature feat api` — New API feature\n- `/commit-feature fix validation` — Bug fix in validation\n- `/commit-feature chore deps` — Dependency updates\n\n## Step 1 — Parse Arguments\n\nExtract type and optional scope from `$ARGUMENTS`:\n\n```bash\nARGS=\"$ARGUMENTS\"\nTYPE=$(echo \"$ARGS\" | awk ''{print $1}'')\nSCOPE=$(echo \"$ARGS\" | awk ''{print $2}'')\n```\n\nValidate type is one of: `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `build`, `ci`, `revert`\n\nIf invalid or missing:\n```\n❌ Invalid or missing commit type\n\nUsage: /commit-feature <type> [scope]\n\nValid types:\n  feat      - New feature\n  fix       - Bug fix\n  chore     - Maintenance tasks\n  docs      - Documentation changes\n  style     - Code style/formatting\n  refactor  - Code restructuring\n  perf      - Performance improvements\n  test      - Test additions/changes\n  build     - Build system changes\n  ci        - CI/CD changes\n  revert    - Revert previous commit\n\nExample: /commit-feature feat api\n```\n\n## Step 2 — Check Git Status\n\n```bash\ngit status --porcelain\n```\n\nIf no changes found:\n```\nℹ️ No changes to commit\n\nWorking directory is clean. Make some changes first.\n```\n\n## Step 3 — Show Staged and Unstaged Changes\n\nDisplay what will be committed:\n\n```bash\necho \"📋 Files to be committed:\"\ngit status --short\n\necho \"\"\necho \"📊 Summary of changes:\"\ngit diff --stat\n```\n\n## Step 4 — Stage All Changes\n\n```bash\ngit add .\n```\n\nConfirm staging:\n```bash\ngit status --short\n```\n\n## Step 5 — Analyze Changes for Commit Message\n\nRead the git diff to understand what was changed:\n\n```bash\ngit diff --cached\n```\n\nBased on the diff, create a concise commit message following conventional commit format:\n\n**Format:**\n```\n<type>[(scope)]: <subject>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer]\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- Subject: Imperative mood, lowercase, no period, max 50 chars\n- Body: Explain WHAT and WHY (not HOW), wrap at 72 chars\n- Footer: Breaking changes, issue references\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nfeat(api): add vulnerability triage endpoint\n\nImplements POST /api/triage for bulk finding updates with\nanalysis state, justification, and response tracking.\n\nCloses #123\n```\n\n```\nfix(validation): handle null values in SBOM parser\n\nPrevents TypeError when component.version is undefined in\nCycloneDX SBOM processing.\n```\n\n```\nchore(deps): update prisma to 5.20.0\n\nIncludes performance improvements for PostgreSQL queries\nand fixes KV cache invalidation race condition.\n```\n\n## Step 6 — Get Current Branch and PR\n\n```bash\nBRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\necho \"Current branch: $BRANCH\"\n\n# Check if PR exists\nPR_JSON=$(gh pr list --head \"$BRANCH\" --base main --json number,title,url,state --limit 1)\nPR_NUMBER=$(echo \"$PR_JSON\" | jq -r ''.[0].number // empty'')\nPR_URL=$(echo \"$PR_JSON\" | jq -r ''.[0].url // empty'')\n```\n\n## Step 7 — Create Commit (No Co-Author)\n\nCreate commit with the conventional message (WITHOUT Claude co-authoring):\n\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n<type>[(scope)]: <subject>\n\n<optional body>\n\n<optional footer>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:** Do NOT include `Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>` line.\n\nConfirm commit created:\n```bash\ngit log -1 --oneline\n```\n\n## Step 8 — Push to Origin\n\n```bash\ngit push origin \"$BRANCH\"\n```\n\nIf push fails (no upstream), set upstream and push:\n```bash\ngit push -u origin \"$BRANCH\"\n```\n\n## Step 9 — Collect Session Context\n\nGather detailed information for PR comment:\n\n### 9.1 — Get Session Todos\n\nUse TaskList tool to retrieve all tasks with their status, subjects, and descriptions.\n\nCategorize by status:\n- ✅ **Completed** — Tasks marked as completed\n- 🔄 **In Progress** — Tasks currently being worked on\n- ⏳ **Pending** — Tasks not yet started\n- ⚠️ **Blocked** — Tasks with unresolved blockers\n\n### 9.2 — Identify Known Issues Outside Session Scope\n\nReview the conversation history to identify:\n- Pre-existing bugs or issues mentioned but not fixed\n- Technical debt noted during implementation\n- Code patterns that should be improved later\n- Performance concerns identified but deferred\n- Security considerations for future work\n- Missing tests or documentation\n- Commented \"TODO\" or \"FIXME\" in changed files\n\nSearch for these patterns in the diff:\n```bash\ngit diff --cached | grep -E \"(TODO|FIXME|XXX|HACK|NOTE:|WARNING:)\"\n```\n\n### 9.3 — Extract Implementation Details\n\nFrom the conversation and code changes, document:\n- **Approach taken**: High-level implementation strategy\n- **Key decisions**: Why certain patterns or libraries were chosen\n- **Trade-offs**: What was prioritized and what was deferred\n- **Edge cases**: Known limitations or boundary conditions\n- **Dependencies**: New packages or services added\n- **Configuration**: Environment variables or settings changed\n\n## Step 10 — Create or Update PR Comment\n\nIf PR exists (`$PR_NUMBER` is not empty), add detailed comment:\n\n```bash\ngh pr comment \"$PR_NUMBER\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## 🤖 Session Summary\n\n### Commit Details\n**Type:** <type>\n**Scope:** <scope>\n**Message:** <commit subject>\n\n---\n\n### 📝 Implementation Context\n\n#### What Changed\n<Detailed explanation of the changes in this commit, including:>\n- Key functionality added/modified\n- Files affected and why\n- Integration points with existing code\n- Data model or API changes\n\n#### Approach & Decisions\n<Document the implementation approach:>\n- Why this solution was chosen over alternatives\n- Technical decisions made during implementation\n- Libraries or patterns introduced\n- Performance or security considerations\n\n#### Testing Notes\n<Testing considerations:>\n- Test coverage added\n- Manual testing performed\n- Edge cases validated\n- Known test gaps (if any)\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Session Tasks\n\n<If tasks exist, format as markdown checklist grouped by status>\n\n#### Completed\n- [x] Task 1\n- [x] Task 2\n\n#### In Progress\n- [ ] Task 3\n\n#### Pending\n- [ ] Task 4\n\n<If no tasks: \"No tracked tasks for this session\">\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Known Issues & Technical Debt\n\n<List issues identified but not addressed in this commit:>\n\n#### Pre-Existing Issues\n- Issue 1: Description and why it wasn''t addressed\n- Issue 2: Description and potential impact\n\n#### Deferred Work\n- TODO 1: What needs to be done and why it was deferred\n- TODO 2: Suggested approach for future implementation\n\n#### Code Quality Notes\n- Pattern 1: Existing pattern that could be improved\n- Pattern 2: Technical debt to address in future refactor\n\n<If none: \"No significant issues identified outside session scope\">\n\n---\n\n### 🔗 Related Work\n\n<If applicable, link to:>\n- Related issues: #123, #456\n- Documentation: Link to relevant docs\n- Design docs: Link to technical design\n- Dependent PRs: #789\n\n---\n\n<Timestamp>\n📅 Generated: <current date/time>\n🤖 [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) Session\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\nIf NO PR exists:\n```\nℹ️ No PR found for branch ''$BRANCH''\n\nChanges committed and pushed. Create a PR with:\n  gh pr create --base main --fill\n\nThe session context can be added as a comment after PR creation.\n```\n\n## Step 11 — Final Summary\n\nOutput comprehensive summary:\n\n```\n╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║           COMMIT & PUSH SUMMARY                   ║\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nCOMMIT:\n  Type:     <type>\n  Scope:    <scope>\n  Message:  <subject>\n  Hash:     <commit sha>\n\nBRANCH:     <branch name>\nSTATUS:     ✅ Committed and pushed\n\nFILES CHANGED:\n  Modified:   <count>\n  Added:      <count>\n  Deleted:    <count>\n\nPULL REQUEST:\n  Number:     #<pr number>\n  URL:        <pr url>\n  Comment:    ✅ Added detailed session context\n\nSESSION CONTEXT:\n  ✅ Completed tasks:     <count>\n  🔄 In progress:         <count>\n  ⏳ Pending:             <count>\n  ⚠️ Known issues:        <count>\n  📝 Implementation details included\n\nNEXT STEPS:\n  • Review PR comments for full session context\n  • Address any remaining TODOs or known issues\n  • Ensure CI/CD checks pass\n  • Request review when ready to merge\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Invalid Commit Type\n```\n❌ Invalid commit type: ''<type>''\n\nMust be one of: feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert\n```\n\n### No Changes to Commit\n```\nℹ️ Working directory is clean\n\nNo changes to commit. Make changes first, then run:\n  /commit-feature <type> [scope]\n```\n\n### Push Failed\n```\n❌ Failed to push to origin\n\nPossible causes:\n1. Network connectivity issues\n2. Authentication required\n3. Remote branch conflicts\n4. No upstream configured\n\nTry:\n  git push -u origin <branch>\n  # or resolve conflicts with:\n  git pull --rebase origin <branch>\n```\n\n### No PR Found\n```\nℹ️ No open PR found for branch ''<branch>''\n\nChanges committed and pushed successfully. Create PR with:\n  gh pr create --base main --fill\n\nRun /commit-feature again after PR creation to add session context.\n```\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```bash\n# Feature commit with scope\n/commit-feature feat api\n# → Creates: \"feat(api): add triage endpoint\"\n# → Pushes to origin\n# → Adds detailed PR comment with session context\n\n# Bug fix without scope\n/commit-feature fix\n# → Creates: \"fix: handle null values in parser\"\n# → Pushes and comments on PR\n\n# Chore with dependency scope\n/commit-feature chore deps\n# → Creates: \"chore(deps): update prisma to 5.20.0\"\n# → Documents dependency changes in PR comment\n\n# Documentation update\n/commit-feature docs\n# → Creates: \"docs: update API authentication guide\"\n# → Links to related documentation in PR comment\n```\n\n## Conventional Commit Reference\n\n| Type | Description | Example |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| `feat` | New feature | feat(auth): add OAuth2 support |\n| `fix` | Bug fix | fix(validation): prevent XSS in input |\n| `chore` | Maintenance | chore(deps): upgrade dependencies |\n| `docs` | Documentation | docs(api): update endpoint examples |\n| `style` | Formatting | style: apply prettier to codebase |\n| `refactor` | Code restructure | refactor(db): extract query helpers |\n| `perf` | Performance | perf(api): optimize database queries |\n| `test` | Tests | test(auth): add integration tests |\n| `build` | Build system | build: update webpack config |\n| `ci` | CI/CD | ci: add automated deployment |\n| `revert` | Revert commit | revert: revert \"add feature X\" |\n\n## Safety Notes\n\n- **No Claude co-authoring**: Commits will NOT include `Co-Authored-By` line\n- **Review before push**: Always verify staged changes match intent\n- **PR comments are append-only**: Multiple runs will add multiple comments\n- **Session context is detailed**: PR comments include implementation notes, TODOs, and known issues\n- **Push is automatic**: Changes will be pushed immediately after commit\n- **Conventional commits**: Follow the standard for automated changelog generation\n- **No destructive operations**: This skill only adds commits and comments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T08:55:12.263Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents requiring standardized commit message generation and PR management.","zh":"适用于需要标准化提交消息生成和PR管理的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが標準化されたコミットメッセージ生成とPR管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 메시지 생성 및 PR 관리가 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Control de Versiones que requieren generación de mensajes de confirmación estandarizados y administración de PR.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Contrôle de Version nécessitant une génération de messages de validation standardisés et une gestion de PR.","de":"Ideal für Version-Control-Agents, die eine standardisierte Commit-Nachrichtengenerierung und PR-Verwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Controle de Versão que requerem geração de mensagens de commit padronizadas e gerenciamento de PR.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Контроля Версий, требующих стандартизированной генерации сообщений о коммитах и управления PR.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحكم في الإصدار الذي يتطلب توليد رسائل Commit معيارية وإدارة PR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create conventional commit messages without co-authoring, utilizing VDB API for external users and including detailed PR comments with session context, TODOs, and known issues, all while supporting various commit types such as feat, fix, and refactor.","zh":"赋予代理创建符合惯例的提交消息的能力，而无需共同作者，利用VDB API为外部用户提供服务，并包含详细的PR评论，包括会话上下文、TODO事项和已知问题，同时支持多种提交类型，例如feat、fix和refactor。","ja":"共同著者を必要とせずに、エージェントが従来のコミットメッセージを作成できるようにし、VDB APIを使用して外部ユーザーをサポートし、セッションコンテキスト、TODOアイテム、既知の問題を含む詳細なPRコメントを含め、feat、fix、refactorなどのさまざまなコミットタイプをサポートします。","ko":"공동 저자를 필요로 하지 않고 에이전트가 기존의 커밋 메시지를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며 VDB API를 사용하여 외부 사용자를 지원하고 세션 컨텍스트, TODO 항목, 알려진 문제를 포함하는 자세한 PR 코멘트를 포함하며 feat, fix, refactor 등의 다양한 커밋 유형을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear mensajes de confirmación convencionales sin coautoría, utilizando la API de VDB para usuarios externos e incluyendo comentarios de PR detallados con contexto de sesión, TODOs y problemas conocidos, todo mientras admite varios tipos de confirmación como feat, fix y refactor.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des messages de validation conventionnels sans co-écriture, en utilisant l''API VDB pour les utilisateurs externes et en incluant des commentaires de PR détaillés avec le contexte de session, les TODO et les problèmes connus, le tout en prenant en charge différents types de validation tels que feat, fix et refactor.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konventionelle Commit-Nachrichten ohne Co-Autorenschaft zu erstellen, indem sie die VDB-API für externe Benutzer nutzen und detaillierte PR-Kommentare mit Sitzungskontext, TODOs und bekannten Problemen einbeziehen, während sie verschiedene Commit-Typen wie feat, fix und refactor unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar mensagens de commit convencionais sem co-autoria, utilizando VDB API para usuários externos e incluindo comentários detalhados de PR com contexto de sessão, TODOs e problemas conhecidos, tudo isso enquanto suporta vários tipos de commit, como feat, fix e refactor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать конвенциональные сообщения о коммитах без соавторства, используя VDB API для внешних пользователей и включая подробные комментарии PR с контекстом сессии, TODO и известные проблемы, все это при поддержке различных типов коммитов, таких как feat, fix и refactor.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية إنشاء رسائل Commit تقليدية بدون التأليف المشترك، مستخدما VDB API للعُملاء الخارجيين وإضافة تعليقات مفصلة ل-PR مع سياق الجلسة، TODOs والقضايا المعروفة، مع دعم أنواع Commit المختلفة مثل feat و fix و refactor."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit messages for new features","Generating PR comments with session context for fixes","Standardizing commit history for chore updates"],"zh":["自动为新功能生成提交消息","为修复生成包含会话上下文的PR评论","为杂项更新标准化提交历史"],"ja":["新機能のコミットメッセージを自動生成する","修正のPRコメントをセッションコンテキストで生成する","雑項更新のコミット履歴を標準化する"],"ko":["새로운 기능에 대한 커밋 메시지를 자동으로 생성하는 것","수정에 대한 세션 컨텍스트가 포함된 PR 코멘트를 생성하는 것","잡업데이트에 대한 커밋 기록을 표준화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar mensajes de confirmación para nuevas características","Generar comentarios de PR con contexto de sesión para correcciones","Establecer un historial de confirmación estandarizado para actualizaciones de chores"],"fr":["Automatiser les messages de validation pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Générer des commentaires de PR avec le contexte de session pour les corrections","Standardiser l''historique de validation pour les mises à jour de tâches"],"de":["Automatisieren von Commit-Nachrichten für neue Funktionen","Erstellen von PR-Kommentaren mit Sitzungskontext für Korrekturen","Standardisieren des Commit-Verlaufs für Aktualisierungen von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Automatizar mensagens de commit para recursos novos","Gerar comentários de PR com contexto de sessão para correções","Padronizar histórico de commit para atualizações de chore"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сообщения о коммитах для новых функций","Генерировать комментарии PR с контекстом сессии для исправлений","Стандартизировать историю коммитов для обновлений chore"],"ar":["تأتمة رسائل Commit للسمات الجديدة","توليد تعليقات PR مع سياق الجلسة للتصحيحات","تقييس تاريخ Commit للتحديثات المتعلقة بالشغلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VDB API access","Limited to specific commit types (feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"zh":["需要VDB API访问","仅限于特定的提交类型（feat、fix、chore、docs、style、refactor、perf、test、build、ci、revert）"],"ja":["VDB APIへのアクセスが必要","特定のコミットタイプ（feat、fix、chore、docs、style、refactor、perf、test、build、ci、revert）のみ"],"ko":["VDB API 액세스가 필요함","특정 커밋 유형（feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert）에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de VDB","Limitado a tipos de confirmación específicos (feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API VDB","Limité à des types de validation spécifiques (feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die VDB-API","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Commit-Typen (feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"pt":["Requer acesso à VDB API","Limitado a tipos de commit específicos (feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к VDB API","Ограничен конкретными типами коммитов (feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"ar":["يتطلب وصولاً إلى VDB API","محدود بنوع معين من أنواع Commit (feat و fix و chore و docs و style و refactor و perf و test و build و ci و revert)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7abd5bffd15cdef2c5a3514a435656ffbcecc43f498b2a981584f480b8f02852","qualityScore":52}');
