],"ja":["AIエージェント","OpenClawスキルパック","開発者ツール","CLIツール","baoyu-cover-imageの使い方","baoyu-cover-imageのインストール","baoyu-cover-imageのドキュメント"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","OpenClaw 스킬 팩","개발자 툴","CLI 툴","baoyu-cover-image 사용법","baoyu-cover-image 설치","baoyu-cover-image 문서"],"es":["cómo usar baoyu-cover-image","qué es OpenClaw","alternativas a baoyu-cover-image","baoyu-cover-image vs OpenClaw","instalación de baoyu-cover-image","guía de configuración de baoyu-cover-image","desarrollo de herramientas de AI","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser baoyu-cover-image","qu''est-ce que OpenClaw","alternatives à baoyu-cover-image","baoyu-cover-image vs OpenClaw","installation de baoyu-cover-image","guide de configuration de baoyu-cover-image","développement d''outils d''IA","outils d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man baoyu-cover-image verwendet","was ist OpenClaw","alternativen zu baoyu-cover-image","baoyu-cover-image vs OpenClaw","installation von baoyu-cover-image","konfigurationsanleitung für baoyu-cover-image","entwicklung von KI-Tools","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar baoyu-cover-image","o que é baoyu-cover-image","alternativas para baoyu-cover-image","baoyu-cover-image vs OpenClaw","instalar baoyu-cover-image","guia de configuração do baoyu-cover-image"],"ru":["как использовать baoyu-cover-image","что такое baoyu-cover-image","альтернативы для baoyu-cover-image","baoyu-cover-image vs OpenClaw","установить baoyu-cover-image","руководство по настройке baoyu-cover-image"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام baoyu-cover-image","ما هو baoyu-cover-image","بديلات ل baoyu-cover-image","baoyu-cover-image مقابل OpenClaw","تثبيت baoyu-cover-image","دليل إعداد baoyu-cover-image"]}},"owner":"Jackiexiao","repo":"jackie-skills-starter","repoPath":"Jackiexiao/jackie-skills-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.956Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-cover-image","description":"Generates article cover images with 5 dimensions (type, palette, rendering, text, mood) combining 9 color palettes and 6 rendering styles. Supports cinematic (2.35:1), widescreen (16:9), and square (1:1) aspects. Use when user asks to generate cover image, create article cover, or make cover.","bodyPreview":"# Cover Image Generator\n\nGenerate elegant cover images for articles with 5-dimensional customization.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto-select dimensions based on content\n/baoyu-cover-image path/to/article.md\n\n# Quick mode: skip confirmation\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --quick\n\n# Specify dimensions\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --type conceptual --palette warm --rendering flat-vector\n\n# Style presets (shorthand for palette + rendering)\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --style blueprint\n\n# With reference","body":"# Cover Image Generator\n\nGenerate elegant cover images for articles with 5-dimensional customization.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto-select dimensions based on content\n/baoyu-cover-image path/to/article.md\n\n# Quick mode: skip confirmation\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --quick\n\n# Specify dimensions\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --type conceptual --palette warm --rendering flat-vector\n\n# Style presets (shorthand for palette + rendering)\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --style blueprint\n\n# With reference images\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --ref style-ref.png\n\n# Direct content input\n/baoyu-cover-image --palette mono --aspect 1:1 --quick\n[paste content]\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--type <name>` | hero, conceptual, typography, metaphor, scene, minimal |\n| `--palette <name>` | warm, elegant, cool, dark, earth, vivid, pastel, mono, retro |\n| `--rendering <name>` | flat-vector, hand-drawn, painterly, digital, pixel, chalk |\n| `--style <name>` | Preset shorthand (see [Style Presets](references/style-presets.md)) |\n| `--text <level>` | none, title-only, title-subtitle, text-rich |\n| `--mood <level>` | subtle, balanced, bold |\n| `--font <name>` | clean, handwritten, serif, display |\n| `--aspect <ratio>` | 16:9 (default), 2.35:1, 4:3, 3:2, 1:1, 3:4 |\n| `--lang <code>` | Title language (en, zh, ja, etc.) |\n| `--no-title` | Alias for `--text none` |\n| `--quick` | Skip confirmation, use auto-selection |\n| `--ref <files...>` | Reference images for style/composition guidance |\n\n## Five Dimensions\n\n| Dimension | Values | Default |\n|-----------|--------|---------|\n| **Type** | hero, conceptual, typography, metaphor, scene, minimal | auto |\n| **Palette** | warm, elegant, cool, dark, earth, vivid, pastel, mono, retro | auto |\n| **Rendering** | flat-vector, hand-drawn, painterly, digital, pixel, chalk | auto |\n| **Text** | none, title-only, title-subtitle, text-rich | title-only |\n| **Mood** | subtle, balanced, bold | balanced |\n| **Font** | clean, handwritten, serif, display | clean |\n\nAuto-selection rules: [references/auto-selection.md](references/auto-selection.md)\n\n## Galleries\n\n**Types**: hero, conceptual, typography, metaphor, scene, minimal\n→ Details: [references/types.md](references/types.md)\n\n**Palettes**: warm, elegant, cool, dark, earth, vivid, pastel, mono, retro\n→ Details: [references/palettes/](references/palettes/)\n\n**Renderings**: flat-vector, hand-drawn, painterly, digital, pixel, chalk\n→ Details: [references/renderings/](references/renderings/)\n\n**Text Levels**: none (pure visual) | title-only (default) | title-subtitle | text-rich (with tags)\n→ Details: [references/dimensions/text.md](references/dimensions/text.md)\n\n**Mood Levels**: subtle (low contrast) | balanced (default) | bold (high contrast)\n→ Details: [references/dimensions/mood.md](references/dimensions/mood.md)\n\n**Fonts**: clean (sans-serif) | handwritten | serif | display (bold decorative)\n→ Details: [references/dimensions/font.md](references/dimensions/font.md)\n\n## File Structure\n\nOutput directory per `default_output_dir` preference:\n- `same-dir`: `{article-dir}/`\n- `imgs-subdir`: `{article-dir}/imgs/`\n- `independent` (default): `cover-image/{topic-slug}/`\n\n```\n<output-dir>/\n├── source-{slug}.{ext}    # Source files\n├── refs/                  # Reference images (if provided)\n│   ├── ref-01-{slug}.{ext}\n│   └── ref-01-{slug}.md   # Description file\n├── prompts/cover.md       # Generation prompt\n└── cover.png              # Output image\n```\n\n**Slug**: 2-4 words, kebab-case. Conflict: append `-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS`\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Progress Checklist\n\n```\nCover Image Progress:\n- [ ] Step 0: Check preferences (EXTEND.md) ⛔ BLOCKING\n- [ ] Step 1: Analyze content + save refs + determine output dir\n- [ ] Step 2: Confirm options (6 dimensions) ⚠️ unless --quick\n- [ ] Step 3: Create prompt\n- [ ] Step 4: Generate image\n- [ ] Step 5: Completion report\n```\n\n### Flow\n\n```\nInput → [Step 0: Preferences] ─┬─ Found → Continue\n                               └─ Not found → First-Time Setup ⛔ BLOCKING → Save EXTEND.md → Continue\n        ↓\nAnalyze + Save Refs → [Output Dir] → [Confirm: 6 Dimensions] → Prompt → Generate → Complete\n                                              ↓\n                                     (skip if --quick or all specified)\n```\n\n### Step 0: Load Preferences ⛔ BLOCKING\n\nCheck EXTEND.md existence (priority: project → user):\n```bash\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-cover-image/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-cover-image/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n| Result | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| Found | Load, display summary → Continue |\n| Not found | ⛔ Run first-time setup ([references/config/first-time-setup.md](references/config/first-time-setup.md)) → Save → Continue |\n\n**CRITICAL**: If not found, complete setup BEFORE any other steps or questions.\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Content\n\n1. **Save reference images** (if provided) → [references/workflow/reference-images.md](references/workflow/reference-images.md)\n2. **Save source content** (if pasted, save to `source.md`)\n3. **Analyze content**: topic, tone, keywords, visual metaphors\n4. **Deep analyze references** ⚠️: Extract specific, concrete elements (see reference-images.md)\n5. **Detect language**: Compare source, user input, EXTEND.md preference\n6. **Determine output directory**: Per File Structure rules\n\n### Step 2: Confirm Options ⚠️\n\nFull confirmation flow: [references/workflow/confirm-options.md](references/workflow/confirm-options.md)\n\n| Condition | Skipped | Still Asked |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `--quick` or `quick_mode: true` | 6 dimensions | Aspect ratio (unless `--aspect`) |\n| All 6 + `--aspect` specified | All | None |\n\n### Step 3: Create Prompt\n\nSave to `prompts/cover.md`. Template: [references/workflow/prompt-template.md](references/workflow/prompt-template.md)\n\n**CRITICAL - References in Frontmatter**:\n- Files saved to `refs/` → Add to frontmatter `references` list\n- Style extracted verbally (no file) → Omit `references`, describe in body\n- Before writing → Verify: `test -f refs/ref-NN-{slug}.{ext}`\n\n**Reference elements in body** MUST be detailed, prefixed with \"MUST\"/\"REQUIRED\", with integration approach.\n\n### Step 4: Generate Image\n\n1. **Backup existing** `cover.png` if regenerating\n2. **Check image generation skills**; if multiple, ask preference\n3. **Process references** from prompt frontmatter:\n   - `direct` usage → pass via `--ref` (use ref-capable backend)\n   - `style`/`palette` → extract traits, append to prompt\n4. **Generate**: Call skill with prompt file, output path, aspect ratio\n5. On failure: auto-retry once\n\n### Step 5: Completion Report\n\n```\nCover Generated!\n\nTopic: [topic]\nType: [type] | Palette: [palette] | Rendering: [rendering]\nText: [text] | Mood: [mood] | Font: [font] | Aspect: [ratio]\nTitle: [title or \"visual only\"]\nLanguage: [lang] | Watermark: [enabled/disabled]\nReferences: [N images or \"extracted style\" or \"none\"]\nLocation: [directory path]\n\nFiles:\n✓ source-{slug}.{ext}\n✓ prompts/cover.md\n✓ cover.png\n```\n\n## Image Modification\n\n| Action | Steps |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Regenerate** | Backup → Update prompt file FIRST → Regenerate |\n| **Change dimension** | Backup → Confirm new value → Update prompt → Regenerate |\n\n## Composition Principles\n\n- **Whitespace**: 40-60% breathing room\n- **Visual anchor**: Main element centered or offset left\n- **Characters**: Simplified silhouettes; NO realistic humans\n- **Title**: Use exact title from user/source; never invent\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Step 0** for paths.\n\nSupports: Watermark | Preferred dimensions | Default aspect/output | Quick mode | Custom palettes | Language\n\nSchema: [references/config/preferences-schema.md](references/config/preferences-schema.md)\n\n## References\n\n**Dimensions**: [text.md](references/dimensions/text.md) | [mood.md](references/dimensions/mood.md) | [font.md](references/dimensions/font.md)\n**Palettes**: [references/palettes/](references/palettes/)\n**Renderings**: [references/renderings/](references/renderings/)\n**Types**: [references/types.md](references/types.md)\n**Auto-Selection**: [references/auto-selection.md](references/auto-selection.md)\n**Style Presets**: [references/style-presets.md](references/style-presets.md)\n**Compatibility**: [references/compatibility.md](references/compatibility.md)\n**Visual Elements**: [references/visual-elements.md](references/visual-elements.md)\n**Workflow**: [confirm-options.md](references/workflow/confirm-options.md) | [prompt-template.md](references/workflow/prompt-template.md) | [reference-images.md](references/workflow/reference-images.md)\n**Config**: [preferences-schema.md](references/config/preferences-schema.md) | [first-time-setup.md](references/config/first-time-setup.md) | [watermark-guide.md](references/config/watermark-guide.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:11.631Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing advanced cover image generation with 5-dimensional customization.","zh":"非常适合需要高级封面图像生成的内容创作代理，具有 5 维可定制化。","ja":"コンテンツ作成エージェントが高度なカバーアイメージ生成を必要とする場合に最適で、5 次元のカスタマイズが可能です。","ko":"내용 생성 에이전트가 고급 커버 이미지 생성을 필요로 할 때 완벽하게 적합하며 5차원 커스터마이즈가 가능합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan generación de imágenes de portada avanzada con personalización de 5 dimensiones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu ayant besoin de génération d''images de couverture avancée avec personnalisation de 5 dimensions.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Titelbildgenerierung mit 5-dimensionalen Anpassungsmöglichkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que necessitam de geração avançada de imagens de capa com personalização em 5 dimensões.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов по Созданию Контента, которым требуется расширенное создание обложек с 5-мерной настройкой.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إنشاء المحتوى الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء متقدم لصور الغلاف مع تخصيص خماسي الأبعاد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate elegant cover images for articles using customizable dimensions, palettes, and rendering styles, including support for conceptual types, warm color palettes, and flat-vector rendering, all accessible via a simple command-line interface with options like --style and --quick for streamlined workflows.","zh":"赋予代理生成文章的优雅封面图像的能力，使用可定制的尺寸、调色板和渲染样式，包括对概念类型、暖色调色板和平面矢量渲染的支持，所有这些都可以通过简单的命令行接口访问，如 --style 和 --quick 选项，实现流畅的工作流程。","ja":"エージェントが記事の優雅なカバーアイメージを生成する能力を付与します。カスタマイズ可能な寸法、パレット、レンダリングスタイルを使用し、概念タイプ、暖色パレット、フラットベクターレンダリングを含むすべての機能にアクセスできます。シンプルなコマンドラインインターフェイスを使用して --style および --quick オプションなどのオプションを利用し、ワークフローを効率化します。","ko":"에이전트가 기사의 우아한 커버 이미지를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 사용자 지정 가능한 치수, 팔레트 및 렌더링 스타일을 사용하고, 개념 유형, 따뜻한 색상 팔레트 및 평면 벡터 렌더링을 포함한 모든 기능에 액세스할 수 있습니다. 이는 간단한 명령줄 인터페이스를 통해 --style 및 --quick와 같은 옵션을 사용하여 워크플로를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar imágenes de portada elegantes para artículos utilizando dimensiones personalizables, paletas y estilos de renderizado, incluyendo compatibilidad con tipos conceptuales, paletas de colores cálidos y renderizado vectorial plano, todo accesible a través de una interfaz de línea de comandos simple con opciones como --style y --quick para flujos de trabajo optimizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des images de couverture élégantes pour les articles en utilisant des dimensions personnalisables, des palettes et des styles de rendu, y compris la prise en charge des types conceptuels, des palettes de couleurs chaudes et du rendu vectoriel plat, le tout accessible via une interface de ligne de commande simple avec des options comme --style et --quick pour des flux de travail rationalisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, elegante Titelbilder für Artikel zu generieren, indem sie anpassbare Dimensionen, Paletten und Rendering-Stile verwenden, einschließlich Unterstützung für Konzepttypen, warme Farbpaletten und flaches Vektor-Rendering, alles über eine einfache Befehlszeilen-Schnittstelle mit Optionen wie --style und --quick für optimierte Workflows zugänglich.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerar imagens de capa elegantes para artigos usando dimensões, paletas e estilos de renderização personalizáveis, incluindo suporte para tipos conceituais, paletas de cores quentes e renderização flat-vector, tudo acessível via uma interface de linha de comando simples com opções como --style e --quick para fluxos de trabalho simplificados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать элегантные обложки для статей с использованием настраиваемых размеров, палитр и стилей рендеринга, включая поддержку концептуальных типов, теплых цветовых палитр и плоско-векторного рендеринга, все доступно через простой интерфейс командной строки с такими опциями, как --style и --quick для оптимизированных рабочих процессов.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء صور غلاف أنيقة للمقالات باستخدام أبعاد وألوان وأنماط عرض قابلة للتخصيص، بما في ذلك الدعم للأنواع المفاهيمية، وألوان البالتة الدافئة، وعرض flat-vector، كلها يمكن الوصول إليها عبر واجهة سطر أوامر بسيطة مع خيارات مثل --style و --quick لتبسيط سير العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating cover image generation for blog articles with personalized style presets","Generating conceptual cover images with specific palettes and rendering styles for social media posts","Creating uniform cover images for a series of articles using the --style blueprint option for consistency"],"zh":["使用个性化样式预设自动为博客文章生成封面图像","为社交媒体帖子生成具有特定调色板和渲染样式的概念封面图像","使用 --style 蓝图选项为一系列文章创建统一的封面图像，以保持一致性"],"ja":["パーソナライズされたスタイルプリセットを使用してブログ記事のカバーアイメージを自動生成する","ソーシャルメディア投稿用に特定のパレットとレンダリングスタイルを使用したコンセプトカバーアイメージを生成する","一連の記事に一貫性を持たせるために --style ブループリントオプションを使用して統一されたカバーアイメージを作成する"],"ko":["개인화된 스타일 프리셋을 사용하여 블로그 기사의 커버 이미지를 자동으로 생성합니다.","소셜 미디어 포스트용으로 특정 팔레트 및 렌더링 스타일을 사용하여 개념 커버 이미지를 생성합니다.","일련의 기사에 일관성을 유지하기 위해 --style 블루프린트 옵션을 사용하여 통일된 커버 이미지를 생성합니다."],"es":["Automatización de la generación de imágenes de portada para artículos de blog con preajustes de estilo personalizados","Generación de imágenes de portada conceptuales con paletas y estilos de renderizado específicos para publicaciones en redes sociales","Creación de imágenes de portada uniformes para una serie de artículos utilizando la opción de plano --style para la coherencia"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération d''images de couverture pour les articles de blog avec des préréglages de style personnalisés","Génération d''images de couverture conceptuelles avec des palettes et des styles de rendu spécifiques pour les publications sur les réseaux sociaux","Création d''images de couverture uniformes pour une série d''articles en utilisant l''option de plan --style pour la cohérence"],"de":["Automatisierung der Titelbildgenerierung für Blogartikel mit personalisierten Stilvorgaben","Generierung von konzeptionellen Titelbildern mit spezifischen Paletten und Rendering-Stilen für Social-Media-Beiträge","Erstellung einheitlicher Titelbilder für eine Artikelreihe unter Verwendung der --style-Blueprint-Option für Konsistenz"],"pt":["Automatização da geração de imagens de capa para artigos de blog com predefinições de estilo personalizadas","Geração de imagens de capa conceituais com paletas e estilos de renderização específicos para postagens em mídias sociais","Criação de imagens de capa uniformes para uma série de artigos usando a opção --style blueprint para consistência"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания обложек для статей блога с персонализированными预设 стиля","Создание концептуальных обложек с определенными палитрами и стилями рендеринга для публикаций в социальных сетях","Создание единообразных обложек для серии статей с использованием опции --style blueprint для обеспечения согласованности"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء صور الغلاف لمقالات المدونات مع إعدادات النمط المخصصة المسبقة","إنشاء صور غلاف مفاهيمية بألوان وأنماط عرض محددة لمنشورات وسائل التواصل الاجتماعي","إنشاء صور غلاف موحدة لسلسلة من المقالات باستخدام خيار --style blueprint للاتساق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires article content for analysis","Limited to generating cover images","Dependent on the quality of the input article for optimal results"],"zh":["需要文章内容进行分析","仅限生成封面图像","依赖于输入文章的质量以获得最佳结果"],"ja":["分析のために記事の内容が必要です","カバーアイメージの生成のみに限られます","最適な結果を得るには、入力記事の品質に依存します"],"ko":["분석을 위해 기사 내용이 필요합니다.","커버 이미지 생성만으로 제한됩니다.","최적의 결과를 얻으려면 입력 기사의 품질에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere contenido de artículo para el análisis","Limitado a la generación de imágenes de portada","Dependiente de la calidad del artículo de entrada para resultados óptimos"],"fr":["Nécessite du contenu d''article pour l''analyse","Limité à la génération d''images de couverture","Dépendant de la qualité de l''article d''entrée pour des résultats optimaux"],"de":["Benötigt Artikelinhalt für die Analyse","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Titelbildern","Abhängig von der Qualität des Eingabeartikels für optimale Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Requer o conteúdo do artigo para análise","Limitado à geração de imagens de capa","Dependente da qualidade do artigo de entrada para obter resultados ideais"],"ru":["Требуется содержание статьи для анализа","Ограничено созданием обложек","Зависит от качества входной статьи для получения оптимальных результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب محتوى المقال للتحليل","مقتصر على إنشاء صور الغلاف","يعتمد على جودة المقالة المدخلة للحصول على نتائج مثالية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bf9efcba2325aa8c673b788be213b072c28e9c150042608a923d59484b2ed397","qualityScore":52}');
